      "sourceTextSha256": "6f5a283804179b720f1a3b446450f0179236667431084b34143ce8aae6ef4402",
      "text": "After breakfast, meet your guide at 07:30 and set off for Tikal, one of the largest and most impressive Maya cities.\n\nYour guide will introduce you to the history of Maya civilisation and show you around the archaeological site. Lunch is included in the park.\n\nReturn to Flores in the afternoon. You can spend the evening by the lake or have dinner in town, the capital of the Petén region.\n\nOvernight in Flores at Hotel Casona del Lago.",
